# Cavernous Maws (WotG 1) with ENABLE_WOTG 0 and the mission current: the maw's own script (xi.maws) gives
# NOTHING_HAPPENS, not 500. ENABLE_WOTG set to 1 again: 500 plays, and its finish completes the mission (the Pure White
# Feather, maw teleport bit 4).
lists BatalliaDowns/Cavernous_Maw/onTrigger BatalliaDowns/onEventFinish/500 RolanberryFields/Cavernous_Maw/onTrigger RolanberryFields/onEventFinish/500 SauromugueChampaign/Cavernous_Maw/onTrigger SauromugueChampaign/onEventFinish/500
char zone=BatalliaDowns pos=-48,0.1,435 job=WAR lvl=99
setting ENABLE_WOTG 0
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Wotg CavernousMaws current
login
trigger Cavernous_Maw                   # xi.maws' NOTHING_HAPPENS
finish-if-event
setting ENABLE_WOTG 1
trigger Cavernous_Maw                   # 500
finish-if-event
